cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QuranicWords or its open dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "QuranicWords: Qur'anic Arabic vocabulary in 8 languages"
abstract: >-
  An open-source curriculum, Android app, web app and dataset for learning the vocabulary of the
  Qur'an: 3,833 lemmas (97.4% of the Qur'an's text) and 1,423 roots, with meanings in English,
  Bangla, Urdu, Hindi, Indonesian, Turkish, Persian and French, each tied to a complete ayah.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "DEANY BYTES"
    email: deanybytes@gmail.com
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/deanybytes/QuranicWords"
url: "https://quranicwords.vercel.app/"
keywords:
  - Quran
  - Quranic Arabic
  - Arabic vocabulary
  - Arabic roots
  - word by word Quran
  - Quran dictionary
  - dataset
  - language learning
  - spaced repetition
references:
